  "sourceTitle": "Evaluating multi-agent systems for explainability and helpfulness with Amazon Bedrock AgentCore",
  "sourceBodyHash": "618ecebe26978c5113d387ae75f21eb21c2703233af5b82d3180fc34a645f793",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "bigmodel",
  "requestedModel": "glm-4.7-flash",
  "model": "glm-4.7-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-06T06:53:03.717603Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T18:44:38.299870Z",
  "totalBlocks": 96,
  "translatedBlocks": 96,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c1980108387440f",
      "translationZh": "随着多智能体系统从实验阶段迈入生产环境，一个关键挑战在于确保这些系统在真实场景中始终保持有帮助、准确且可解释。企业越来越多地采用多智能体系统来解决需要跨数据源、工具和业务约束进行推理的复杂真实世界问题。从供应链规划到金融分析和客户运营，这些系统已经超越了简单的问答。它们协调多个专门的智能体以做出决策、执行工作流并生成可操作的建议。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e0abbd7042293e2",
      "translationZh": "虽然大型语言模型能够生成流畅的响应，但企业级应用需要更深层次的保证，即智能体必须可靠地遵循指令、选择合适的工具、遵守约束条件，并为其输出提供清晰的推理过程。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64ba05c36a7803e2",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 是一个平台，可在任何框架或模型的基础上大规模构建、连接和优化智能体。Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能，旨在作为一项完全托管的能力来应对这一挑战，用于在开发和生产环境中评估智能体性能，以便团队能够在多个质量维度上测量准确性、任务成功率和行为。传统的仅关注模型响应质量的评估方法对于智能体系统而言是不够的，因为在这些系统中，正确性取决于工具选择、工作流执行以及对业务约束的遵守。除了评估之外，智能体系统的生产部署还需要负责任的 AI 控制。Amazon Bedrock Guardrails 提供可配置的防护措施，如内容过滤、被拒绝主题检测和基础验证，以补充评估框架。虽然评估是在执行后评估智能体质量，但 Guardrails 在执行过程中强制执行安全约束。在这篇文章中，我们重点介绍如何通过 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 对内置评估器和自定义评估器的支持来操作化这一评估框架。内置评估器提供了对有帮助性、任务成功率和指令遵循等常见质量维度的预定义评估，使团队能够在无需额外设置的情况下快速建立智能体性能基线。然而，企业用例需要更深入的、特定领域的验证。自定义评估器正是为了满足这一需求，使您能够定义感知业务的检查。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee0f514d3893289c",
      "translationZh": "我们还特别关注可解释性作为一级评估维度。我们演示了内置评估器如何评估一般响应的清晰度。我们展示了自定义评估器如何用于验证智能体是否明确阐述决策依据、引用支持数据或工具输出，并解释诸如成本与服务水平之间的权衡。通过结合这些评估器，我们展示了 AgentCore Evaluations 如何能够超越表层响应质量，提供有结构且可度量的洞察，以了解智能体如何以及为何得出其决策。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c80be978752ee2a",
      "translationZh": "为了使这些概念具体化，以下章节将通过一个参考架构和实现来演示这些组件在实践中如何协同工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07627932216ddb0a",
      "translationZh": "对于此篇文章，我们使用一个名为 AnyCompany Retail 的虚构全球零售公司，这是一家跨国零售商，运营着电子商务渠道、区域履约中心、分销中心以及数千家实体店。AnyCompany 经常出现库存失衡：某些地区在促销期间会出现缺货，而其他地区则积压过多库存。运输团队还需要平衡交付速度、承运商容量和成本。该公司希望拥有一个智能体助手，能够帮助规划者优化库存分配、推荐分销调整、分析库存健康状况，并模拟路由或履约场景。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe196246d721ca5e",
      "translationZh": "您将使用 Strands Agents SDK 、 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore MCP Server 和 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 构建并评估一个多智能体供应链决策系统。该解决方案使用 Strands Agents，包含一个编排器智能体和四个专门的子智能体：优化智能体、分销智能体、路由智能体和分析智能体。每个智能体在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时上运行，并启用了 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 内存和 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 可观测性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07e5f94ce673dbd3",
      "translationZh": "编排器智能体接收规划者的请求，并将工作委托给作为工具暴露的专门智能体。优化智能体调用由模拟 Amazon API Gateway REST 接口支持的 MCP 工具，以返回优化决策。分销智能体调用推荐 API，以建议在履约中心、商店和数字渠道之间重新平衡库存。路由智能体调用物流 API，以推荐承运商和路线选项，而分析智能体则回答供应链诊断问题。该解决方案在 Amazon Bedrock 上使用基础模型来驱动智能体循环。有关按地区的模型可用性，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的 Supported models by AWS Region。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "197e9f2dba07684a",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案使用内置评估器来评估诸如有用性和任务完成度等一般质量维度。它还提供自定义评估器来评估供应链特定行为，例如约束满足度、路线可行性、SQL 正确性、库存基础和解释质量。AnyCompany 可以同时评估响应的语言质量以及智能体决策的业务有效性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d992d2b8a823b129",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案通过 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 支持按需模式和在线模式。按需模式用于开发基准测试、回归测试以及持续集成和持续交付（CI/CD）门禁。在线模式用于持续的生产监控和警报。这两种模式都有助于您闭环并根据用户反馈采取行动。用于按需评估的相同自定义评估器（例如，来自您的供应链解决方案的约束满足度、路线可行性、SQL 正确性和可解释性评估器）将通过一个 OnlineEvaluationConfig 对象重新利用，该对象引用评估器的 Amazon Resource Names（ARNs），并指定采样率（例如，生产轨迹的 1–10%），以及可选的会话过滤器。然后，该服务会自动从 AgentCore Observability 读取轨迹，对其进行评分，并将结果流式传输到 Amazon CloudWatch 仪表板和警报。在本文中，您将使用按需模式来测试该解决方案。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e63ec4a32500a5f",
      "translationZh": "以下架构图展示了我们解决方案的各个组成部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "055b6220654f8c34",
      "translationZh": "图 1：多智能体供应链决策解决方案的架构",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a016c10ffe24e79f",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，您将使用一种三层评估方法来评估多智能体系统，逐步建立企业信任。该方法遵循清晰的进展：首先使用内置评估器进行一般质量评估，然后添加自定义评估器以评估业务准确性，最后叠加可解释性评估器以实现信任和可审计性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a37b1f8018dc41b",
      "translationZh": "第一层使用无需设置的内置评估器。我们将 Helpfulness 作为通用基线，并添加第二个特定于智能体的评估器，针对每个智能体的主要失效模式：编排器的 Tool Selection Accuracy，优化和分发的 Response Relevance，路由的 Instruction Following，以及分析的 Faithfulness。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e506ca4db7be1f2",
      "translationZh": "第二层添加编码特定领域业务规则的自定义评估器：优化的 constraint satisfaction，分发的 data grounding，路由的 route feasibility，分析的 SQL correctness，以及编排的 plan coherence。这些用于验证业务有效性：推荐是否尊重了预算限制，使用了真实的库存数据，并产生了在操作上正确的输出？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb10348f7ff3487a",
      "translationZh": "下表映射了为每个智能体在此处实现的两个内置评估器和自定义评估器。第二个内置评估器针对每个智能体的主要失效模式，而自定义评估器编码了用于验证操作正确性的特定领域业务规则。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e61f23b1abfff9cd",
      "translationZh": "有用性; 工具选择准确性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "517897917f142341",
      "translationZh": "计划一致性评估器：它是否将子智能体的输出组合成一个有效且不矛盾的建议？工具轨迹评估器：它是否路由到了正确的子智能体？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e9c4bc1dcd5eb4c",
      "translationZh": "有用性; 响应相关性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d54ca35b880609cc",
      "translationZh": "约束满足评估器：预算、库存覆盖（需求 ≤ 数量 ≤ 2× 需求）以及仓库容量约束。关键绩效指标（KPI）达成评估器：填充率/收入改善目标已达成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d87b2acb241dc88e",
      "translationZh": "推荐可靠性评估器：推荐基于当前库存/需求数据。风险影响评估器：推荐改善缺货/过剩风险。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb0b43eadd981593",
      "translationZh": "有用性；指令遵循",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3485c2e1d0d065dd",
      "translationZh": "路线可行性评估器：路线遵守交付窗口、成本、承运商容量和区域限制。服务水平协议（SLA）评估器：预期交付达到目标服务水平。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "216c61cb7648d140",
      "translationZh": "有用性；忠实度",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cbda7233bb8f669",
      "translationZh": "SQL 正确性评估器：查询匹配用户意图。数据基础评估器：响应得到 Amazon Relational Database Service（Amazon RDS）查询结果的支持。无未经支持的声明评估器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7d3a214d25e0ec6",
      "translationZh": "我们评估方法的第三层在代理之间应用可解释性评估器作为独立的、交叉切割的检查。这些评估器独立评估代理是否阐述决策依据、引用工具输出中的支持证据、解释哪些约束塑造了响应、阐述竞争目标之间的权衡、澄清为何调用特定子代理，并在数据不完整时披露假设。通过将可解释性分离为自己的评估层，我们可以独立衡量透明度。一个推荐可能准确但不可解释（通过自定义评估器但未通过可解释性评估），这为团队提供了可操作的信号，以判断代理是否需要更好地阐述推理而不是更好的决策逻辑。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "228cf58750978af9",
      "translationZh": "下表定义了您在此实现的六个独立的可解释性评估器，这些评估器作为交叉切割层应用于代理。这些评估器评估代理是否阐述推理、引用证据、解释约束和权衡以及披露假设。它们与准确性分开测量，以便团队能够区分不可解释但正确的响应和解释充分但错误的响应。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1921c1617628225d",
      "translationZh": "决策依据质量",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23a9a72fcb4e67ba",
      "translationZh": "该智能体是否解释了它做出该推荐的原因？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ffb147840b153d44",
      "translationZh": "分析、分发、路由",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b86e630176b3468",
      "translationZh": "它是否引用了所使用的数据字段、API 响应或 SQL 结果？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33f6e1749a3e7c15",
      "translationZh": "它是否解释了哪些约束塑造了最终回复？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c470ccb42a26b8d",
      "translationZh": "优化、分发、路由",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "046be594d19c0b85",
      "translationZh": "它是否解释了成本、服务水平和库存风险之间的权衡？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a38c0672bbdb698",
      "translationZh": "它是否解释了为什么调用每个子智能体或 MCP 工具？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eab0b3f1daa613a3",
      "translationZh": "当数据不完整时，它是否明确说明了假设？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbbcb7366ccddb31",
      "translationZh": "在部署此解决方案之前，请使用以下工具设置您的开发环境。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "164b72e35a125fbe",
      "translationZh": "安装 AWS 命令行界面（AWS CLI）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8dc02b4195717029",
      "translationZh": "安装 AWS Serverless Application Model (AWS SAM) CLI v1.100.0 或更高版本",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f1ffc7ed139fca4",
      "translationZh": "安装 Node.js v18.x 或更高版本",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55aa3cb93701880f",
      "translationZh": "Strands Agents 的实现还需要包含在 DockerFile 中打包的以下依赖项：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "823aa6adf697b34c",
      "translationZh": "strands-agents # Strands Agents 多智能体框架",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0b1c1ad679eb35d",
      "translationZh": "strands-agents-tools # Strands 智能体工具和实用程序",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74dbefbe60fd7552",
      "translationZh": "requests # 用于 API 调用的 HTTP 库",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5578e1a0e901054",
      "translationZh": "bedrock-agentcore # Amazon Bedrock 智能体核心功能",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9e7e37a54d6e1b3",
      "translationZh": "boto3 # Python 的 AWS SDK (Boto3)",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8f052cc57435f125",
      "translationZh": "部署并运行解决方案",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b97167f118d2ad89",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案可从我们的 GitHub 仓库下载，并提供单步部署功能，以便在您的 AWS 环境中部署并访问该解决方案：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee00016b308fa243",
      "translationZh": "输出包括运行时 ARN、AnyCompany 零售 API URL、评估器 API URL 和内存 ARN。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43c2772ad8ce549f",
      "translationZh": "请按照以下步骤运行该解决方案：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "645a388faac6d3f1",
      "translationZh": "test_client/ 文件夹包含一个 Python 脚本，该脚本通过 20 个示例查询（每个子代理 5 个）调用部署的供应链代理，以验证端到端功能。每个类别都以多轮会话形式运行，会话 ID 将在最后打印，以便与评估器 API 配合使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0b21673e483071a",
      "translationZh": "运行所有查询（共 20 个，4 个会话）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "308da5a9268f418c",
      "translationZh": "运行特定的子代理类别",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35115cfa72d90dd0",
      "translationZh": "测试客户端会打印每个查询以及代理的完整响应。最后，它会打印用于评估器的会话 ID。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b93c29359c83a00",
      "translationZh": "创建并运行评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0efeff055dd4902",
      "translationZh": "test_evaluators/ 文件夹包含针对代理会话运行评估的脚本。这些评估异步运行，结果将作为 markdown 文件保存到 S3 中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b44c3c6317784e0",
      "translationZh": "您必须首先按照前文所述调用供应链决策多代理解决方案，以生成带有追踪记录的代理会话，并记录测试客户端运行结束时打印的会话 ID。最后，在运行解决方案后等待 3-5 分钟，以便追踪记录传播到 CloudWatch。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bccee82324c17fbc",
      "translationZh": "创建自定义评估器",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "269fd1be7b455e7c",
      "translationZh": "这会注册自定义评估器并打印它们的 ID。请保存这些 ID 以便在 run 命令中使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5f2bf6c92c34850",
      "translationZh": "传入一个以逗号分隔的评估器 ID 列表（自定义或内置）。至少需要 1 个：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a5c8fdc5b365d01",
      "translationZh": "API 会立即返回 202。结果将异步保存到 S3，路径为：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fdfdb6660b38477c",
      "translationZh": "运行优化评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d1a855ac7031c72",
      "translationZh": "既然您已经了解了评估框架并部署了解决方案，让我们开始对优化智能体进行一次专注的端到端评估。本次演练演示了如何将自定义业务准确性评估器（第 2 层）与可解释性评估器（第 3 层）相结合，以评估优化决策的正确性和透明度。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e793fea0cda750f6",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：运行优化查询",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e6401696791d644",
      "translationZh": "首先，仅调用带有优化类别的测试客户端，以生成一个专注的会话：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "673d6d7be90d1d40",
      "translationZh": "这以多轮会话的形式运行 5 个优化查询。智能体处理诸如“prod-001 在未来 30 天内的最佳库存水平是多少？”之类的请求。每个查询都需要优化智能体调用 MCP 工具、检索需求预测，并生成在预算、库存覆盖率和仓库容量约束下符合要求的补货建议。运行结束时，测试客户端会打印优化会话 ID。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c60aa675e81b18f6",
      "translationZh": "第 2 步：运行约束满足评估器（第 2 层：业务准确性）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3197ae22ef7fca23",
      "translationZh": "在生成优化会话后，运行自定义的约束满足评估器，以验证智能体的补货建议是否符合业务规则。该评估器会同时检查三个约束条件：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72d8b6e1a3773b17",
      "translationZh": "预算：增量持有成本是否符合剩余预算 (budget_limit − budget_used)？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5804d04011d0868",
      "translationZh": "库存覆盖率：建议水平是否 ≥ 需求预测（避免缺货）且 ≤ 2× 需求（避免过剩）？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f802de4964418d39",
      "translationZh": "仓库容量：建议水平是否符合可用仓库空间？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55704e20fa4fe1ee",
      "translationZh": "运行该评估器以及内置的帮助性（Helpfulness）和响应相关性（Response Relevance）评估器：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b4ca2db51280b1c",
      "translationZh": "API 会立即返回 HTTP 202。评估异步运行。结果保存到 S3：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be7c25f0048a4d4a",
      "translationZh": "第 3 步：运行可解释性评估器（第 3 层：信任与可审计性）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5fe7314be781c1b",
      "translationZh": "在确认优化代理能够生成满足约束条件的建议后，下一个问题是：它是否解释了其推理过程？一个建议可能是准确的但却是不透明的。此类建议虽然通过了约束评估器，但未能阐明其为何选择特定的库存水平。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d292a2bf07ba47f4",
      "translationZh": "使用第 1 步中相同的优化会话 ID，现在运行适用于该优化代理的两个可解释性评估器：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8dfc938dc17f543c",
      "translationZh": "决策依据质量 —— 代理是否解释了其做出该建议的原因？（例如，“建议 1,500 个单位，因为需求预测为 1,200，且我们的目标是 1.25 倍的安全系数”)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb556e5c3a97e463",
      "translationZh": "约束推理 —— 代理是否解释了哪些约束条件塑造了最终响应？（例如，“预算允许最多 1,800 个单位，但仓库容量将我们限制在 1,600 个单位，因此我们建议 1,500 个单位”)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80daca0031ab343c",
      "translationZh": "这些评估器独立地评估透明度。它们的衡量标准与准确性是分开的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1ec1aeddf4e2905",
      "translationZh": "解读组合结果",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc84626cad1c2df5",
      "translationZh": "通过对同一个优化会话运行所有三个评估器，您可以获得代理在两个维度上的完整质量图景：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fe92a9e840dd8df",
      "translationZh": "业务准确性（第 2 层）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebd211ccf319237f",
      "translationZh": "建议在操作上是否正确？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a0c6d264a5a6f8d",
      "translationZh": "可解释性（第 3 层）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9de80a86d29e2742",
      "translationZh": "智能体为何做出此项建议？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9f1a31b2a72b1ca",
      "translationZh": "哪些约束条件塑造了该回复？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2800446dd0df7990",
      "translationZh": "表 3：跨质量维度的评估覆盖范围",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d09973cee928e75",
      "translationZh": "这种分层方法能够实现有针对性的改进。如果约束满足分数很高但可解释性分数很低，说明智能体的决策逻辑是合理的，但其沟通能力需要改进。相反，如果可解释性很高但违反了约束条件，则说明智能体能够很好地阐述推理过程，但应用了错误的逻辑。每种故障模式都有不同的修复路径，而评估框架使这种区分变得可衡量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "560fb3ea47b30d2a",
      "translationZh": "为避免产生重复费用，请在尝试解决方案后，通过单个步骤清理您的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "823d2b6ea1e0edb5",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们演示了如何使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 构建和评估多智能体供应链决策系统，重点在于验证智能体行为不仅具备功能性，而且还要有帮助、准确和可解释。基于 AnyCompany Retail Group 场景，我们展示了编排智能体和专门子智能体如何协作解决诸如库存分配、分发规划、路由优化和供应链诊断等复杂问题，同时与企业数据源和 API 集成。正如架构中所示，智能体系统的正确性不仅取决于响应质量，还依赖于选择合适的工具、执行正确的工作流、遵守业务约束以及将输出基于数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cd79a33c5e220ba",
      "translationZh": "通过将内置评估器与自定义评估器相结合，团队可以系统地验证通用响应质量和特定领域决策的准确性。加入以可解释性为重点的评估器，进一步确保代理能够清晰阐述其推理过程，引用支持数据，并以业务用户能够信任并采取行动的方式解释权衡。这种以评估为驱动的方法利用真实执行数据实现持续改进，在生产发布前建立质量门槛，并提供一个可扩展的框架，以交付一致、透明且与业务目标一致的多智能体系统。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b1f865f91866acd",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，请探索 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations，并将这些模式应用到您自己的多智能体应用中。在 GitHub 上的 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 示例仓库中查找完整的源代码。首先启用可观测性，为您的用例定义关键评估维度，然后逐步引入内置和自定义评估器，以衡量最重要的内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b98a6ca8a44ff676",
      "translationZh": "要了解更多信息，请访问 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 服务页面，或直接在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台开始使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9ac59be82e72c21",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 构建可靠的 AI 代理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ec4b9ba9c9097d7",
      "translationZh": "在 AWS 中使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 构建高度可扩展的无服务器 LangGraph 多智能体系统",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7ca00b6d371bcb1",
